  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Logic : (2nd number - 1st number) = (3rd number ÷ 4) **\n\n**Given :**\n\n \n• (17, 35, 72)\n\n35 - 17 = 72 ÷ 4\n\n18 = 18 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (13, 27, 56)\n\n27 - 13 = 56 ÷ 4\n\n14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (11, 24, 50)\n\n24 - 11 = 50 ÷ 4\n\n13 ≠ 12.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (15, 31, 64)\n\n31 - 15 = 64 ÷ 4\n\n**16 = 16 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (18, 36, 110)\n\n36 - 18 = 110 ÷ 4\n\n18 ≠ 27.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (12, 25, 50)\n\n25 - 12 = 50 ÷ 4\n\n13 ≠ 12.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.",
